################################################################################
#
# SKWIFI NV (Non-Volatile) Files
#
# This directory contains NV files required for the SKW (Seekwave)
# WiFi/BT module calibration and configuration.
#
# IMPORTANT: These NV files must be obtained from Seekwave or the
# original SDK. They are NOT included in this repository due to
# licensing restrictions.
#
# Required Files:
# ---------------
# 1. SEEKWAVE_NV_SWT6652.bin - NV data for SV6160/SWT6652 module
# 2. Other platform-specific NV files as needed
#
# How to Obtain:
# --------------
# Method 1: From SDK
#   The NV files are located in the SDK at:
#   /path/to/rockchip_sdk/external/rkwifibt/nv/
#
# Method 2: From Seekwave
#   Contact Seekwave directly to obtain the NV files.
#
# Installation:
# -------------
# Copy these files to:
#   - Target rootfs: /lib/firmware/seekwave/
#   - Or kernel source: /firmware/seekwave/ (for building into kernel)
#
# Note: The NV file name should match the compatible string in the
# device tree: "seekwave,sv6160"
#
################################################################################

# Placeholder for NV files
# Copy the actual NV files from SDK:
#   cp /path/to/sdk/external/rkwifibt/nv/*.bin ./

# Example command to copy from SDK:
# cp ../../../mc_platform/rockchip_sdk/external/rkwifibt/nv/SEEKWAVE_NV_SWT6652.bin ./
